 "sentences": [
  {
   "text": "Your client has found the property.",
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 1.836
  },
  {
   "text": "The big question?",
   "start": 2.258,
   "end": 3.029
  },
  {
   "text": "Can they afford it?",
   "start": 3.366,
   "end": 4.515
  },
  {
   "text": "Traditionally, answering that means chasing documents, juggling spreadsheets, and waiting on internal teams and external partners.",
   "start": 4.93,
   "end": 12.557
  },
  {
   "text": "With ARIXA systems, everything changes.",
   "start": 12.8,
   "end": 15.618
  },
  {
   "text": "One simple client questionnaire captures and organizes their information, seamlessly populating their client card.",
   "start": 16.051,
   "end": 22.791
  },
  {
   "text": "Now, here's where speed meets opportunity.",
   "start": 23.258,
   "end": 25.886
  },
  {
   "text": "With just one click, ARIXA turns client information into magic, where one aspect allows you to obtain an indicative borrowing capacity assessment, revealing estimated purchasing power, deposit requirements, financial commitments, and key considerations tailored to their specific circumstances.",
   "start": 26.349,
   "end": 44.887
  },
  {
   "text": "From information to financial insight in moments.",
   "start": 45.356,
   "end": 48.584
  },
  {
   "text": "And why stop there?",
   "start": 49.036,
   "end": 49.995
  },
  {
   "text": "Bring their chosen property into focus.",
   "start": 50.448,
   "end": 52.509
  },
  {
   "text": "Adjust deposits, explore financial structures, model purchasing scenarios, and generate professional reports that turn numbers into meaningful decisions.",
   "start": 52.937,
   "end": 62.481
  },
  {
   "text": "Ready for the next step?",
   "start": 62.949,
   "end": 64.022
  },
  {
   "text": "One click, one connected handover.",
   "start": 64.448,
   "end": 66.832
  },
  {
   "text": "Share assessments and scenarios directly with yours or their allocated finance broker through ARIXA's partner portal, enabling professional review without repeating the entire process.",
   "start": 67.3,
   "end": 78.426
  },
  {
   "text": "Your client gains clarity and transparency, and the broker gains context.",
   "start": 78.872,
   "end": 83.409
  },
  {
   "text": "Your business gains momentum.",
   "start": 83.808,
   "end": 85.636
  },
  {
   "text": "And that's just the beginning.",
   "start": 86.122,
   "end": 87.4
  },
  {
   "text": "Property intelligence, financial analysis, professional reporting, client communication and partner collaboration are all connected, with the ERIXA agent in your arsenal supporting you wherever your business takes you.",
   "start": 87.854,
   "end": 101.094
  },
  {
   "text": "This means less administration, faster answers, smarter collaboration, more opportunities to deliver results.",
   "start": 101.593,
   "end": 109.346
  },
  {
   "text": "Erixa Systems has arrived and has been built by property professionals for property professionals.",
   "start": 109.81,
   "end": 115.714
  },
  {
   "text": "Experience the difference with a 14-day free trial.",
   "start": 116.152,
   "end": 119.164
  },
  {
   "text": "Your business, your experience, your decision.",
   "start": 119.602,
   "end": 122.914
  },
  {
   "text": "Erixa Systems, the operating system for modern property professionals.",
   "start": 123.264,
   "end": 127.529
  },
  {
   "text": "Start your free trial today.",
   "start": 127.903,
   "end": 129.52
  }
 ],
